{
  "_note": "「近 7 天稳定性」组件:关注的前 4 个服务,各自近 7 天(按设备时区的自然日)每天最重的事故影响、7 天事故数。只出码与数(w<槽>_<距今天数> = 0 无 · 2 轻微 · 3 部分中断 · 4 重大中断),文案在 .rcn 的 rc.i18n。\n近期事故数据源(2026-09-25 实测后选定,v2):\n· Statuspage 原生(sp):`/history.json` —— 本季度逐月的全部事故,**带 impact 与开始时刻**,7–114KB(未压缩;线上走 gzip 约 3–27KB)。没有更轻的端点:`incidents.json` 全量 140–290KB、`?limit=` / `?per_page=` 均被忽略;`history.rss` 30–77KB 且**没有 impact**(按当日最重影响着色做不到)。\n  ⚠️ 它只覆盖**当前季度**(start_time = 季初):窗口跨进上一季度时另取 `?page=2`。\n  ⚠️ timestamp 是展示串「Sep <var…>24</var>, <var…>16:51</var> - … UTC」,时区按页面(EDT / PDT 也有),偏移从 start_time 取;**月份取 timestamp 开头的缩写**(跨月事故挂在结束月的块下),年取月块。\n· incident.io 兼容层(io):`incidents.json` 最新 25 条(29–41KB),created_at 是 ISO 串,impact 同名。\n· 计划维护(impact = maintenance)不算事故;impact = none 的公告按「轻微异常」计(与页面同一判据)。\n刷新 1 小时一次:它回答的是「这周稳不稳」,不需要 2 分钟一查。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "idsIn",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${ids},)]"
      },
      "_note": "入参落地(勿删)。`ids` 只有「单个服务」22 档会传(一个服务 id,画它的近 7 天方格);「近 7 天稳定性」组件不传 → 读关注列表。"
    },
    {
      "id": "fl",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "follow",
        "default": [
          "github",
          "claude",
          "openai",
          "vercel"
        ]
      },
      "_note": "关注列表(首页「管理关注」写入);没存过时用默认四个。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b0",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "读取屏障(勿删)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "flj",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${idsIn}),0),${idsIn},join::(${fl},~))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "raw",
        "value": "$[split::(${flj},~)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "NM",
        "value": {
          "github": "GitHub",
          "claude": "Claude",
          "openai": "OpenAI",
          "vercel": "Vercel",
          "cursor": "Cursor",
          "npm": "npm",
          "docker": "Docker",
          "bitbucket": "Bitbucket",
          "circleci": "CircleCI",
          "netlify": "Netlify",
          "supabase": "Supabase",
          "render": "Render",
          "digitalocean": "DigitalOcean",
          "mongodb": "MongoDB Cloud",
          "sentry": "Sentry",
          "datadog": "Datadog",
          "linear": "Linear",
          "notion": "Notion",
          "figma": "Figma",
          "postman": "Postman",
          "discord": "Discord",
          "reddit": "Reddit"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "MN",
        "value": {
          "January": "1",
          "February": "2",
          "March": "3",
          "April": "4",
          "May": "5",
          "June": "6",
          "July": "7",
          "August": "8",
          "September": "9",
          "October": "10",
          "November": "11",
          "December": "12"
        }
      },
      "_note": "history.json 月块的英文月名 → 月份数。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "M3",
        "value": {
          "Jan": "1",
          "Feb": "2",
          "Mar": "3",
          "Apr": "4",
          "May": "5",
          "Jun": "6",
          "Jul": "7",
          "Aug": "8",
          "Sep": "9",
          "Oct": "10",
          "Nov": "11",
          "Dec": "12"
        }
      },
      "_note": "timestamp 开头的月份缩写 → 月份数。⚠️ 事故的开始月要从 timestamp 读,不能用所在月块:跨月的事故挂在**结束**那个月块下(supabase「Aug 19, 15:52 - Sep 15」在 September 块里)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cl_x",
        "value": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rid0",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${raw},0),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rv0",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${rid0}),0),if::(gt::(length::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${NM},${rid0}),)),0),1,0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cj_0",
        "value": "${cl_x}~${rid0}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cl_0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${rv0},1),if::(gt::(length::(${cl_x}),0),${cj_0},${rid0}),${cl_x})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rid1",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${raw},1),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rv1",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${rid1}),0),if::(gt::(length::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${NM},${rid1}),)),0),1,0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cj_1",
        "value": "${cl_0}~${rid1}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cl_1",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${rv1},1),if::(gt::(length::(${cl_0}),0),${cj_1},${rid1}),${cl_0})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rid2",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${raw},2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rv2",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${rid2}),0),if::(gt::(length::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${NM},${rid2}),)),0),1,0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cj_2",
        "value": "${cl_1}~${rid2}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cl_2",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${rv2},1),if::(gt::(length::(${cl_1}),0),${cj_2},${rid2}),${cl_1})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rid3",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${raw},3),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rv3",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${rid3}),0),if::(gt::(length::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${NM},${rid3}),)),0),1,0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cj_3",
        "value": "${cl_2}~${rid3}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cl_3",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${rv3},1),if::(gt::(length::(${cl_2}),0),${cj_3},${rid3}),${cl_2})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rid4",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${raw},4),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rv4",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${rid4}),0),if::(gt::(length::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${NM},${rid4}),)),0),1,0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cj_4",
        "value": "${cl_3}~${rid4}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cl_4",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${rv4},1),if::(gt::(length::(${cl_3}),0),${cj_4},${rid4}),${cl_3})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rid5",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${raw},5),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rv5",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${rid5}),0),if::(gt::(length::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${NM},${rid5}),)),0),1,0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cj_5",
        "value": "${cl_4}~${rid5}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cl_5",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${rv5},1),if::(gt::(length::(${cl_4}),0),${cj_5},${rid5}),${cl_4})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "parts",
        "value": "$[split::(${cl_5},~)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nall",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${rv0}+${rv1}+${rv2}+${rv3}+${rv4}+${rv5}),0)]"
      },
      "_note": "关注总数(组件只画前 4 个,多出来的在左下角写「另 N 个」)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k0id",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${parts},0),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k0n",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${k0id}),0),findNotEmpty::(get::(${NM},${k0id}),),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k0v",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${k0n}),0),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k1id",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${parts},1),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k1n",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${k1id}),0),findNotEmpty::(get::(${NM},${k1id}),),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k1v",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${k1n}),0),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k2id",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${parts},2),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k2n",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${k2id}),0),findNotEmpty::(get::(${NM},${k2id}),),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k2v",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${k2n}),0),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k3id",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(index::(${parts},3),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k3n",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${k3id}),0),findNotEmpty::(get::(${NM},${k3id}),),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "k3v",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${k3n}),0),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nowMs",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tH",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${nowMs},HH)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tM",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${nowMs},mm)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tS",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${nowMs},ss)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tod",
        "value": "$[calc::(${tH}*3600000+${tM}*60000+${tS}*1000)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t0",
        "value": "$[calc::(${nowMs}-${tod})]"
      },
      "_note": "今天 0 点(设备时区)。日格按用户自己的自然日切,不按 UTC。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "wsM",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${t0}-7*86400000),MM)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nM",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${nowMs},MM)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "wsQ",
        "value": "$[floor::(calc::((${wsM}-1)/3))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nQ",
        "value": "$[floor::(calc::((${nM}-1)/3))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "p2",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${wsQ},${nQ}),0,1)]"
      },
      "_note": "7 天窗口(多留一天余量,吸收页面时区)跨进上一季度 → 另取 history.json?page=2。一年只有 4×8 天会走到。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tY",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${nowMs},yyyy)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tMo",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(${nowMs},MM),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tD",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(${nowMs},dd),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tdadj",
        "value": "$[if::(le::(${tMo},2),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tdyoe",
        "value": "$[calc::(${tY}-2000-${tdadj})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tdmp",
        "value": "$[calc::(${tMo}-3+12*${tdadj})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tddb",
        "value": "$[floor::(calc::((153*${tdmp}+2)/5))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tdq4",
        "value": "$[floor::(calc::(${tdyoe}/4))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tddays",
        "value": "$[calc::(11017+${tdyoe}*365+${tdq4}+${tddb}+${tD}-1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tdms",
        "value": "$[calc::(${tddays}*86400000+0*3600000+0*60000-(0)*60000)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tdq",
        "value": "$[floor::(calc::((${tddays}+4)/7))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tdw",
        "value": "$[calc::(${tddays}+4-${tdq}*7)]"
      },
      "_note": "今天星期几(0 = 周日):1970-01-01 是周四。日期轴写星期,不写裸「几号」—— 「2 3 4」读不出是几月几号还是周几。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "wq0",
        "value": "$[floor::(calc::((${tdw}+7-0)/7))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "wd0",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${tdw}+7-0-${wq0}*7),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "wq1",
        "value": "$[floor::(calc::((${tdw}+7-1)/7))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "wd1",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${tdw}+7-1-${wq1}*7),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "wq2",
        "value": "$[floor::(calc::((${tdw}+7-2)/7))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "wd2",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${tdw}+7-2-${wq2}*7),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "wq3",
        "value": "$[floor::(calc::((${tdw}+7-3)/7))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "wd3",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${tdw}+7-3-${wq3}*7),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "wq4",
        "value": "$[floor::(calc::((${tdw}+7-4)/7))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "wd4",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${tdw}+7-4-${wq4}*7),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "wq5",
        "value": "$[floor::(calc::((${tdw}+7-5)/7))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "wd5",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${tdw}+7-5-${wq5}*7),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "wq6",
        "value": "$[floor::(calc::((${tdw}+7-6)/7))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "wd6",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(${tdw}+7-6-${wq6}*7),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dl0",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${t0}-0*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"
      },
      "_note": "日期轴:距今 g 天那一天的「几号」(取当天正午,避开夏令时切换那一小时)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dl1",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${t0}-1*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dl2",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${t0}-2*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dl3",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${t0}-3*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dl4",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${t0}-4*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dl5",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${t0}-5*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dl6",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(formatDate::(calc::(${t0}-6*86400000+43200000),dd),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "HU",
        "value": {
          "github": "https://www.githubstatus.com/history.json",
          "claude": "https://status.claude.com/history.json",
          "openai": "https://status.openai.com/api/v2/incidents.json",
          "vercel": "https://www.vercel-status.com/history.json",
          "cursor": "https://status.cursor.com/history.json",
          "npm": "https://status.npmjs.org/history.json",
          "docker": "https://www.dockerstatus.com/api/v2/incidents.json",
          "bitbucket": "https://bitbucket.status.atlassian.com/history.json",
          "circleci": "https://status.circleci.com/history.json",
          "netlify": "https://www.netlifystatus.com/history.json",
          "supabase": "https://status.supabase.com/history.json",
          "render": "https://status.render.com/history.json",
          "digitalocean": "https://status.digitalocean.com/history.json",
          "mongodb": "https://status.mongodb.com/history.json",
          "sentry": "https://status.sentry.io/history.json",
          "datadog": "https://status.datadoghq.com/history.json",
          "linear": "https://linearstatus.com/api/v2/incidents.json",
          "notion": "https://www.notion-status.com/api/v2/incidents.json",
          "figma": "https://status.figma.com/history.json",
          "postman": "https://status.postman.com/history.json",
          "discord": "https://discordstatus.com/history.json",
          "reddit": "https://www.redditstatus.com/history.json"
        }
      },
      "_note": "每个服务的事故历史地址(sp = history.json,io = incidents.json)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "HU2",
        "value": {
          "github": "https://www.githubstatus.com/history.json?page=2",
          "claude": "https://status.claude.com/history.json?page=2",
          "vercel": "https://www.vercel-status.com/history.json?page=2",
          "cursor": "https://status.cursor.com/history.json?page=2",
          "npm": "https://status.npmjs.org/history.json?page=2",
          "bitbucket": "https://bitbucket.status.atlassian.com/history.json?page=2",
          "circleci": "https://status.circleci.com/history.json?page=2",
          "netlify": "https://www.netlifystatus.com/history.json?page=2",
          "supabase": "https://status.supabase.com/history.json?page=2",
          "render": "https://status.render.com/history.json?page=2",
